  note         = {Read arXiv:1806.07421v3 (2018-09-25), the latest of three revisions, for chapter 08: the deletion and insertion curves and the area under them, and the stated intuition that removing the cause forces the base model to change its decision. The blurred canvas the insertion metric starts from is the paper's own concession that a replacement value is not neutral. The arXiv record names no venue, so the prose names none.},
