  note         = {Read arXiv:1901.09392v4 (2019-11-03), the NeurIPS 2019 camera-ready revision, for chapter 08: definition 2.1, infidelity as the expected squared error between the output change the attribution predicts and the one the model actually shows over a perturbation distribution, and definition 3.1, max-sensitivity over a ball of radius r. The perturbation distribution is described only as meaningful perturbations of interest and is left to whoever runs the metric, which is the free choice chapter 08 reads it for.},
